BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Palestine 36
DTSTART:20260403T231500Z
DTEND:20260404T014000Z
DTSTAMP:20260403T231500Z
UID:QnQ9j4g6EG
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 128 mins (2h08m)\n\nFilmmaker Annemarie Jacir takes 
 us back to Palestine in the 1930s\, charting the lives and ambitions of th
 ose living under British rule. Jeremy Irons and Hiam Abbass round out a tr
 emendously strong international cast.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-th
 eaters/palestine-36\n\nEstimated start: 16:30
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
